window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What began as an unstoppable explosion of passion forged into something pivotal, essential, and more.</b></p> <p><i>King of Libertines</i> is a steamy pirate love story that gives you a taste of the world and characters in <i>Sea of Ruin</i>. It can be listened to before or after the full-length, standalone novel. It doesn’t spoil the main story.</p>"; 
